# Tech Stack

- PHP version 7.4+
- Yii 1.1 Framework (will be udpated to Yii 2 eventually)
- Frontend libraries: jquery 3, jquery-ui 1, bootstrap 3, font-awesome 4
- Composer for dependency management
- Docker and Docker Compose for containerized development and deployment
- Nginx as the web server
- PostgreSQL database
- Testing tools: Codeception and PHPUnit for unit, functional, and acceptance tests
- GitLab CI/CD for continuous integration and deployment
- Vue.js for reactive frontend widgets